":67,"watchers":8306,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ngrx/platform/pulls/4648","html_url":"https://github.com/ngrx/platform/pull/4648","diff_url":"https://github.com/ngrx/platform/pull/4648.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/ngrx/platform/pull/4648.patch","merged_at":"2025-01-08T11:11:08Z"},"body":"Each `signalMethod` instance uses a watcher assigned to it. The watcher is destroyed when the `signalMethod` itself gets destroyed. However, watchers were removed prematurely due to `onDestroy` behavior in `effect`. • `onDestroy` doesn’t run when an effect is destroyed but after each execution. • This caused watchers to be removed after the first execution unexpectedly.\r\n\r\nProblematic Code: `watchers.splice(watchers.indexOf(watcher), 1);`\r\n\r\nThe removal mistakenly affected other watchers, keeping instances running, even after the signalMethod was destroyed.\r\n\r\nCo-authored-by: @davdev82\r\n\r\n## PR Checklist\r\n\r\nPlease check if your PR fulfills the following requirements:\r\n\r\n- [x] The commit message follows our guidelines: https://github.com/ngrx/platform/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md#commit\r\n- [x] Tests for the changes have been added (for bug fixes / features)\r\n- [ ] Documentation has been added / updated (for bug fixes / features)\r\n\r\n## PR Type\r\n\r\nWhat kind of change does this PR introduce?\r\n\r\n```\r\n[x] Bugfix\r\n[ ] Feature\r\n[ ] Code style update (formatting, local variables)\r\n[ ] Refactoring (no functional changes, no api changes)\r\n[ ] Build related changes\r\n[ ] CI related changes\r\n[ ] Documentation content changes\r\n[ ] Other... Please describe:\r\n```\r\n\r\n## What is the current behavior?\r\n\r\neffects are not destroyed.\r\n\r\nCloses #4644\r\n\r\n## Does this PR introduce a breaking change?\r\n\r\n```\r\n[ ] Yes\r\n[x] No\r\n```\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ngrx/platform/issues/4648/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":1,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ngrx/platform/issues/4648/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":15856874565,"node_id":"CE_lADOAXExC86lTPpRzwAAAAOxJLRF","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/events/15856874565","actor":{"login":"thePunderWoman","id":1596273,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1OTYyNzM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1596273?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/thePunderWoman","html_url":"https://github.com/thePunderWoman","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thePunderWoman/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thePunderWoman/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thePunderWoman/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thePunderWoman/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thePunderWoman/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thePunderWoman/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thePunderWoman/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thePunderWoman/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/thePunderWoman/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"closed","commit_id":"5c0d68804e03bcd425e5398e08d9cbe1846b21ca","commit_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/commits/5c0d68804e03bcd425e5398e08d9cbe1846b21ca","created_at":"2025-01-08T16:40:48Z","state_reason":null,"performed_via_github_app":null},{"id":15856874683,"node_id":"REFE_lADOAXExC86lTPpRzwAAAAOxJLS7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/events/15856874683","actor":{"login":"thePunderWoman","id":1596273,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1OTYyNzM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1596273?v